m 0.6em}.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable td,.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable th{border:0;padding:0}</style><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"border-spacing:3px; width:30em;\"><caption class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a></caption><tbody><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollss%C3%A4song\" title=\"Fotbollssäsong\">Säsong</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sport%C3%A5ret_2003\" title=\"Sportåret 2003\">2003</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Vinnare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgården/Älvsjö</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Nedflyttade</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF_Dam\" title=\"Östers IF Dam\">Östers IF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Trion\" title=\"IF Trion\">IF Trion</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Cup_2004/2005\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Cup 2004/2005\">Women's Cup</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgården/Älvsjö</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK_FF\" title=\"Umeå IK FF\">Umeå IK</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Spelade&#160;matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">132</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">524 (4 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Svensson\" title=\"Victoria Svensson\">Victoria Svensson</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgården/Älvsjö</a> (23)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK_FF\" title=\"Umeå IK FF\">Umeå</a> 8–0 <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(29 juli 2003)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Trion\" title=\"IF Trion\">Trion</a> 2–9 <a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgården/Älvsjö</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(1 juni 2003)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Trion\" title=\"IF Trion\">Trion</a> 2–9 <a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgården/Älvsjö</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(1 juni 2003)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Högsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;06068.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>6&#160;068. <a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgården/Älvsjö</a> 1–1 <a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK_FF\" title=\"Umeå IK FF\">Umeå</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(19 oktober 2003)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Lägsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0132.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>132. <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF_Dam\" title=\"Östers IF Dam\">Öster</a> 0–1 <a href=\"/wiki/Mallbackens_IF\" title=\"Mallbackens IF\">Mallbacken</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(25 oktober 2003)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Åskådarantal i snitt</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">922</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2002\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2002\">2002</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2004\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2004\">2004</a> &#8594;</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Damallsvenskan 2003</b> i <a href=\"/wiki/Fotboll\" title=\"Fotboll\">fotboll</a> spelades <a href=\"/wiki/12_april\" title=\"12 april\">12 april</a>-<a href=\"/wiki/25_oktober\" title=\"25 oktober\">25 oktober</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sport%C3%A5ret_2003\" title=\"Sportåret 2003\">2003</a>. Serien hade 22 omgångar. Lag 11-12: nedflyttning. Seger = 3 poäng. Oavgjort = 1 poäng. Förlust = 0 poäng.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lagen\">Lagen</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lagen\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lagen\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Förening\n</th>\n<th>Ort\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bälinge IF</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Uppsala\" title=\"Uppsala\">Uppsala</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Djurgården/Älvsjö</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm\" title=\"Stockholm\">Stockholm</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hammarby IF</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm\" title=\"Stockholm\">Stockholm</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IF Trion</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Karlskrona\" title=\"Karlskrona\">Karlskrona</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Karlslunds IF</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro\" title=\"Örebro\">Örebro</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kopparbergs/Landvetter IF</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"Göteborg\">Göteborg</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mallbackens IF</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sunne\" title=\"Sunne\">Sunne</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Malmö FF</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6\" title=\"Malmö\">Malmö</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stattena IF</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Helsingborg\" title=\"Helsingborg\">Helsingborg</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sunnanå SK</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Skellefte%C3%A5\" title=\"Skellefteå\">Skellefteå</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Umeå IK</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5\" title=\"Umeå\">Umeå</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Östers IF</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4xj%C3%B6\" title=\"Växjö\">Växjö</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Tabeller\">Tabeller</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Tabeller\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Tabeller\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Poängtabell\"><span id=\"Po.C3.A4ngtabell\"></span>Poängtabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Poängtabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Poängtabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2003\" title=\"Mall:Poängtabell för Damallsvenskan 2003\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;action=edit\"><span style=\";\" title=\"Redigera den här mallen\">redigera</span></a></span>&#160;\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"font-size:0.9375em;line-height:1.4em;text-align:center;background:white;margin-top:0.1em;\">\n<tbody><tr><th style=\"width:1.8em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Placering\">Nr</span> </th>\n<th style=\"width: 13em;\"> Lag </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Spelade matcher\">S</span></th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Vinster\">V</span>        </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Oavgjorda\">O</span>      </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Förluster\">F</span>      </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Gjorda mål\">GM</span>    </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Insläppta mål\">IM</span> </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Målskillnad\">MS</span>   </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Poäng\">P</span>          </th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffec8b; border-bottom:2px solid grey;\"> <td>1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgården/Älvsjö</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 19 </td>\n<td> 1  </td>\n<td> 2  </td>\n<td> 94 </td>\n<td> 25 </td>\n<td>+69</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">58</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#c3c3dc; border-bottom:2px solid grey;\"> <td>2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK_FF\" title=\"Umeå IK FF\">Umeå IK</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Regerande mästare\">(RM)</span>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 18 </td>\n<td> 3  </td>\n<td> 1  </td>\n<td> 70 </td>\n<td> 10 </td>\n<td>+60</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">57</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>3</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">Malmö FF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 17 </td>\n<td> 1  </td>\n<td> 4  </td>\n<td> 64 </td>\n<td> 16 </td>\n<td>+48</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">52</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>4</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_DFF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hammarby IF DFF\">Hammarby IF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 13 </td>\n<td> 3  </td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 54 </td>\n<td> 35 </td>\n<td>+19</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">42</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>5</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/B%C3%A4linge_IF\" title=\"Bälinge IF\">Bälinge IF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 10 </td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 50 </td>\n<td> 27 </td>\n<td>+23</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">36</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>6</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">Kopparbergs/Landvetter IF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 9  </td>\n<td> 5  </td>\n<td> 8  </td>\n<td> 49 </td>\n<td> 43 </td>\n<td>+6</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">32</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>7</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunnan%C3%A5_SK\" title=\"Sunnanå SK\">Sunnanå SK</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 5  </td>\n<td> 11 </td>\n<td> 33 </td>\n<td> 52 </td>\n<td>−19</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">23</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>8</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/KIF_%C3%96rebro_DFF\" title=\"KIF Örebro DFF\">Karlslunds IF</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Uppflyttad från föregående säsong\">(U)</span>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 4  </td>\n<td> 7  </td>\n<td> 11 </td>\n<td> 30 </td>\n<td> 53 </td>\n<td>−23</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">19</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>9</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mallbackens_IF\" title=\"Mallbackens IF\">Mallbackens IF</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 4  </td>\n<td> 7  </td>\n<td> 11 </td>\n<td> 22 </td>\n<td> 47 </td>\n<td>−25</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">19</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white; border-bottom:2px solid red;\"> <td>10</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stattena_IF\" title=\"Stattena IF\">Stattena IF</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Uppflyttad från föregående säsong\">(U)</span>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 4  </td>\n<td> 4  </td>\n<td> 14 </td>\n<td> 22 </td>\n<td> 63 </td>\n<td>−41</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">16</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>11</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF_Dam\" title=\"Östers IF Dam\">Östers IF</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Uppflyttad från föregående säsong\">(U)</span>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 2  </td>\n<td> 3  </td>\n<td> 17 </td>\n<td> 20 </td>\n<td> 69 </td>\n<td>−49</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">9</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>12</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Trion\" title=\"IF Trion\">IF Trion</a>  </td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td> 2  </td>\n<td> 3  </td>\n<td> 17 </td>\n<td> 16 </td>\n<td> 84 </td>\n<td>−68</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">9</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Resultattabell\">Resultattabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Resultattabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2003&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Resultattabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Resultattabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2003\" title=\"Mall:Resultattabell för Damallsvenskan 2003\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.or